<title>THAILAND: SCF Finance unaudited year net jumps.</title>
<headline>SCF Finance unaudited year net jumps.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited financial results for SCF Finance and Securities for the year ending 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				  For 12 months</p>
<p>				   1996	 1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 4.90	 3.38</p>
<p>    Net			254.69	168.26</p>
<p>				   Fourth quarter</p>
<p>				   1996	 1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 0.92	 0.82</p>
<p>    Net			 47.86	40.95</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is SCF Finance and Securities Plc. The company is a finance and securities firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
